    body: 'Dear Future Me,\n\nI am writing this letter to you from the present. I hope you are doing well and achieving your goals.\n\nWhen you read this, you might be busy with work or further education. Do you still remember your dreams from when you were young? I hope you have not given up on them. Life can be tough, but never forget why you started.\n\nI want you to know that the hard work you put in during middle school was worth it. Every effort counts, and small steps lead to big achievements. Always stay humble and kind to others.\n\nI also want to remind you to take care of your health. No achievement is worth sacrificing your well-being. Spend time with your family and friends, and do not get too caught up in work.\n\nI believe in you, and I am proud of who you have become.\n\nBest wishes,\nYour Younger Self',
